WEBVTT

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.240
Karen?

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:37.450
Hey, what about Karen?

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:41.080
You shouldn't be worrying about your sister.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:51.200
Pepper, this is your new room from now on.

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:58.200
You are someone who had a
great trial upon your shoulders.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.870
Sleep well.

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:16.410
The smell of another stranger...

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:24.540
Seven, they put us in a new room.

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:31.330
Well. This room, these clothes,
and even my name isn't my own.

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:36.870
Only you...

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:39.330
You're mine.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:17.670
Earnest Desire

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:23.990
I wonder if I'm really here.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:25.540
Hey, Seven...

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:33.490
Seven? Where did you go?

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.910
Come here.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.790
I want to show you something.

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.040
Goodness.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:53.990
I can't believe a soon to be discarded
child would be compatible with it.

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:57.950
We must look over the examination
process for the test subjects...

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:04.660
Seven!

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.450
H-Hey!

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:46.700
I can make this thing mine?

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:53.370
If you survive the Hands
transplant procedure, of course.

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:59.200
The abilities of Gun Slave Unit
Device 7 are particularly high,

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:05.490
but its fragile mental state
has made it notably unstable.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.080
No matter how powerful of a weapon it is,

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:14.580
it will be disposed of if we cannot
find a compatible Hands for it.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:18.490
Though you are not compatible with extensions,

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:23.330
you are somewhat compatible
with Hands technology.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:28.790
If you can control this and
show its use as a tool,

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:35.910
the company shall find worth
in you and treat you accordingly.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:38.830
However, since it is such an unstable unit--

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.040
How stupid.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:46.080
Did she listen to a single thing I've said?!

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.330
Hey, you...

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.950
Goodness.

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:10.120
I want him...

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:15.370
I want him... I want him... I want him!

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:16.830
I want him!

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:24.830
I want him. I want him. I want him!

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:26.040
I want him!

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:35.620
A chain that will connect me to this world.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:40.540
A mark I can use to confirm
my own existence myself!

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:46.790
Dibs!

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:49.240
They called you Device 7?

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:52.080
Looks like you're missing something, too.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.790
Don't worry.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:58.080
I'll get you out of this place.

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:15.080
In exchange, if you ever become anyone else's...

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:20.240
...I'll definitely break you.

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:48.700
You're so nice to women, Juzo.

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:52.790
He's sheltering someone who
destroyed his own office.

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:57.290
Well, I'm getting paid to take care
of her, so I can't really complain.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:59.790
Will she be all right?

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:05.580
You're also too nice, Boy. Goodness.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:09.120
If Chris finds out about this,
we'll all be kicked out.

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:12.260
"No late 
payments on rent!!"

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:19.700
Juzo, are you going out?

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.790
Be careful.

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:27.080
There's more criticism against
Extendeds after what happened.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.660
You're right. Thanks.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:32.410
Your honest reply gives me the shivers.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:36.450
Rosa came by and dropped this off last time.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:37.620
Rosa did?

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:40.950
She said she fixed the rip in your coat.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:45.870
I'm off.

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:48.540
Whoa, Juzo!

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:53.790
Well, it's fine I guess.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:56.450
The recent bombing event at the
End of War Commemoration Park,

00:08:56.450 --> 00:09:00.120
also known as the Armed Plaza,

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:06.370
has been determined as the work of
Spitzbergen by the Reconstruction Agency.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:08.950
Hey, hey. I heard that an illegal Extended
full of weapons went crazy.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:09.950
Over 300 people have been
reported as dead or wounded.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:11.700
Extendeds are the devil, after all.

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:11.700
I repeat...

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:16.450
But, I heard that some of the victims
were saved by getting extensions.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:19.660
They just released a new
sub-brain yesterday, too.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:21.450
It's better on the body, right?

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:23.700
Won't the number of Extendeds increase?

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:28.830
Reconstruction Agency Holy Church Hospital

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:34.830
Hey, Olivier.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.700
Extended Only Hospital Ward

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:46.040
The pairing is complete.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.160
You have 15 minutes.

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:53.240
I'll allow you to meet the witness
alone during that time.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:57.870
In exchange, I'll be listening to
your conversation through that mic.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:03.370
Also, you will tell us everything you
know regarding that Extended.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.120
Understand?

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.040
Yeah, I got it.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:11.490
No smoking in the hospital. Isn't that obvious?

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:13.660
You have my thanks, Olivier.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:21.200
I'm not doing it for you.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.740
After Berühren's cover-up...

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:33.740
...all we found were numerous victims,
the body of professor Wachowski,

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.200
and a single witness.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:39.700
On top of that, the witness cannot
be identified and isn't on the register.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:45.240
We couldn't connect her to Berühren
through her sub-brain history, either.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.700
"Special Procedure Room"

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:52.740
What are you going to do with the witness?

00:10:52.740 --> 00:10:55.950
I'm not the one who decides that.

00:10:55.950 --> 00:11:01.370
Though I suppose she will be put
into a facility and kept under watch.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:09.490
Shut down the building! Quickly!

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:12.290
What is going on! Did she escape?!

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:17.200
Juzo?!

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:19.370
S-So narrow!

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:30.620
My wife and son died because of your fight.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:34.830
They were crushed by the debris
and died while suffering...

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:39.410
Just accept it.

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:42.700
This will be a way for you to pay for your sins.

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:50.580
L-Let me go!

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:50.580
Calm down a bit, old man.

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:51.660
Monster!

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:53.540
You monsters are the cause!

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:57.660
Why?

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:02.160
Why are you alive instead of Seven?

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:07.950
You... There's no way...

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:11.910
Did you become someone's?!

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:17.950
Did you let someone else pull
your trigger without permission?!

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:23.580
Piece of shit!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:32.040
Don't get so worked up, Pepper.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:34.330
Just cause...

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:36.910
Just cause I lost my Hands!

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:40.410
All of you are looking down on me!

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:43.790
He left me all alone!

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:47.990
I'm only doing the job that
I've accepted from him.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:52.830
The job from Seven.

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:13.700
Stop it! You know what'll happen...

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.950
...if you push yourself any farther.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.580
Hey?!

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:41.040
That woman has nothing to do with me.

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:44.330
But, to you, she's...

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:53.290
No matter what she says,
I'm the one who decided to do it.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:57.450
I chose to do everything.

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:05.290
Isn't that right, Juzo Inui?

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:06.580
You...

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:10.040
This is the worst. Seriously.

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:12.790
I can't believe I'm asking you
to do something like this.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:18.540
Inui Juzo...

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:26.490
Take care of Pepper...

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:31.240
...for me.

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:46.950
Twin female Extendeds. They're the
secretaries of Berühren's top officials.

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:49.290
I met them once.

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:56.580
Did they retrieve Seven?

00:14:56.580 --> 00:15:03.200
Gun Slave Units were made as tools for Hands,

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:06.290
but they aren't mentally controlled.

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:10.700
It's just that the units all lose their memories
from all the extension work done,

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.620
making their feelings easier to control.

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:23.290
You thought he was just something you owned,
but he chose to stay by your side.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:36.660
Man, this is so stupid.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.910
So you already have it.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.200
People like that.

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:50.740
Come to think of it, I promised
to tell you if you beat Seven.

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:55.990
I'll tell you where your partner is.

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:02.700
The man you captured was Jean Claude.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:04.490
He's a member of the Security Bureau

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:08.490
that lost his family due to the
Armed Statue bombing case.

00:16:08.490 --> 00:16:11.080
I see.

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:13.830
I listened in.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:17.740
And now I know.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:21.620
No, I've always known.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:26.290
The size of the monster I have to face.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:29.830
My superiors are in collusion with them
and so much has been covered up.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:33.660
I can't stay silent after all they've done.

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:35.580
Olivier.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.290
Go home for today.

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:45.290
Juzo... You're actually quite the womanizer.

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:47.660
Huh? What?

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:52.870
Wh-What the hell is this?!

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:08.910
We will return all your belongings
that have not been taken as evidence.

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:31.240
If that's what you wish for, I'll...

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:36.580
Man, I'm so pissed off...

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:45.580
My clothes reek of gunpowder
because of that guy.

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.330
Quit joking around...

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:27.830
You'll reach the main western military
headquarters once we get through here.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:31.240
Why?

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:33.700
You know, don't you?

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:37.700
What'll happen to you if you go back
to the military after running once.

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:51.290
I'll be disposed of either way.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:54.290
You didn't have to bother coming back.

00:18:56.200 --> 00:19:03.490
I didn't want to treat the partner
that had my back like a tool.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:08.700
But, well... That's my own selfishness.

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:13.240
We were in a war.

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:21.160
As a shooter, I should have
led a tool like you better.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.450
Don't worry.

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:30.700
They shouldn't treat you too bad.

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:35.160
What comes after that is what's important.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:45.120
Laugh, Juzo.

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:51.410
You should do stupid things, struggle,
and suffer like a normal person.

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:56.160
Then make friends you can
laugh about those times with.

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:01.240
You need someone like that.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:07.660
When we can both laugh about
the present like that,

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:13.450
we should meet here again during the
season when all that white fluff dances...

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:16.240
--Juzo.
--Juzo!

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.080
We came to get you.

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:26.040
Chris was worried because
you were late coming home.

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:30.490
Isn't it weird that this place has so many
stairs even though it's a hospital?

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:36.370
While I don't think they'd do
anything rash again so quickly,

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:40.870
have you forgotten that you're
currently being targeted?

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:42.700
That is a reasonable argument,

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:46.830
but I need to get used to the
sub-brain inhibitor that Mary installed.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:49.240
That's right! This is rehabilitation!

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:54.910
Juzo? Was there a problem?

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:00.950
I know now, myself.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:06.330
The size of the monster I have to face.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:13.450
I'll tell you where your partner is.

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:22.870
What are you acting so cool for?

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:25.490
With such a lovely patch on your butt.

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:29.240
You're right. It's quite lovely.

00:21:29.240 --> 00:21:30.660
Good for you.

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:33.870
Such a young lady likes you.

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:35.080
Young lady?

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:39.080
That's right! She's a really
cute girl named Rosa!

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:40.450
H-Hey, Mary!

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:43.790
Did you know about this
and stay quiet about it?!

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:46.990
But it looks good on you, Juzo!

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:50.660
That's not the problem!

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:52.330
Mary!
